1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,730
Carrington. A private
meeting to clear the air.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,950
Jason had invited a camera crew.

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,330
Bruno, if you've got a problem
with the tactics, tell me.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,584
Not the television.

5
00:00:11,594 --> 00:00:14,885
I tried. You said your
door was always open.

6
00:00:14,895 --> 00:00:15,790
It is.

7
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,940
Jason was standing in it.

8
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,907
Look. Maybe I could've been clearer.

9
00:00:22,917 --> 00:00:25,507
And maybe I shouldn't
have said it on telly.

10
00:00:25,517 --> 00:00:26,704
So we're all right?

11
00:00:26,714 --> 00:00:30,274
Yes. I still think
the tactics were shit.

12
00:00:30,384 --> 00:00:33,964
Aye. But now you've told
me indoors. Progress.

13
00:00:38,724 --> 00:00:40,644
Jason. What are you doing?

14
00:00:40,654 --> 00:00:43,114
Clearing the air. It's on the agenda.

15
00:00:43,124 --> 00:00:44,593
That's air freshener.

16
00:00:44,603 --> 00:00:45,983
Fresh start.

17
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:50,448
Next time, just come straight to me.

18
00:00:50,458 --> 00:00:51,898
Move Jason first.

19
00:00:57,158 --> 00:00:59,338
Surprise standards inspection.

20
00:00:59,348 --> 00:01:01,378
Gary, you're not Ofsted.

21
00:01:01,388 --> 00:01:02,678
Who's in charge here?

22
00:01:04,088 --> 00:01:05,858
It's a collaborative structure.

23
00:01:07,318 --> 00:01:08,575
Special measures.
